{
  "task_id": "powerlifting-coef-calc",
  "top_k": 5,
  "requirements": [
    {
      "requirement_id": "req_a28ebee36f0007ca1c8c",
      "requirement_type": "FORMAT",
      "criticality": "CORE",
      "provenance": {
        "source_file": "tasks/powerlifting-coef-calc/instruction.md",
        "source_type": "instruction",
        "line_start": 2,
        "line_end": 3,
        "exact_text": "You need to calculate the lifting scores for International Powerlifting Federation competitions in the file `/root/data/openipf.xlsx`.\nThe workbook contains two sheets:\n",
        "source_sha256": "30b6b162c2ffae69085956e124a1aac018356108a7b9e41d8681507984cce538",
        "extraction_rule": "actionable_paragraph"
      }
    },
    {
      "requirement_id": "req_956355b6a9c47c9f5f69",
      "requirement_type": "DOMAIN_ACTION",
      "criticality": "SUPPORT",
      "provenance": {
        "source_file": "tasks/powerlifting-coef-calc/instruction.md",
        "source_type": "instruction",
        "line_start": 4,
        "line_end": 4,
        "exact_text": "1. \"Data\" which contains all performance records of lifters,\n",
        "source_sha256": "30b6b162c2ffae69085956e124a1aac018356108a7b9e41d8681507984cce538",
        "extraction_rule": "commonmark_list_item"
      }
    },
    {
      "requirement_id": "req_26b4cff82db44e0a1396",
      "requirement_type": "DOMAIN_ACTION",
      "criticality": "SUPPORT",
      "provenance": {
        "source_file": "tasks/powerlifting-coef-calc/instruction.md",
        "source_type": "instruction",
        "line_start": 5,
        "line_end": 7,
        "exact_text": "2. \"Dots\" which is empty for you to work on.\nThe entries for \"Data\" are documented in `/root/data/data-readme.md`.\n\n",
        "source_sha256": "30b6b162c2ffae69085956e124a1aac018356108a7b9e41d8681507984cce538",
        "extraction_rule": "commonmark_list_item"
      }
    },
    {
      "requirement_id": "req_4d405d9f3c254becb543",
      "requirement_type": "PRESERVATION",
      "criticality": "CORE",
      "provenance": {
        "source_file": "tasks/powerlifting-coef-calc/instruction.md",
        "source_type": "instruction",
        "line_start": 8,
        "line_end": 10,
        "exact_text": "You need to calculate the [Dots](https://powerliftpro.app/understanding-the-dots-score-in-powerlifting-a-comprehensive-guide/)\ncoefficients for each competitor.\nPlease keep 3 digits precision for all computation.\n",
        "source_sha256": "30b6b162c2ffae69085956e124a1aac018356108a7b9e41d8681507984cce538",
        "extraction_rule": "actionable_paragraph"
      }
    },
    {
      "requirement_id": "req_c49f80aab73396a32772",
      "requirement_type": "PRESERVATION",
      "criticality": "CORE",
      "provenance": {
        "source_file": "tasks/powerlifting-coef-calc/instruction.md",
        "source_type": "instruction",
        "line_start": 12,
        "line_end": 14,
        "exact_text": "Step 1: Find which columns are needed to compute Dots.\nCopy these columns to \"Dots\" with the lifters' name.\nKeep the order and names of the columns the same in \"Dots\" as in \"Data\".\n",
        "source_sha256": "30b6b162c2ffae69085956e124a1aac018356108a7b9e41d8681507984cce538",
        "extraction_rule": "actionable_paragraph"
      }
    },
    {
      "requirement_id": "req_c1a8cf0af183753310ab",
      "requirement_type": "DOMAIN_ACTION",
      "criticality": "CORE",
      "provenance": {
        "source_file": "tasks/powerlifting-coef-calc/instruction.md",
        "source_type": "instruction",
        "line_start": 16,
        "line_end": 18,
        "exact_text": "Step 2: With the data you have in \"Dots\",\nappend a new column \"TotalKg\" after the existing columns,\nusing Excel formula to compute each lifter's total lifted weights in Kg,\n",
        "source_sha256": "30b6b162c2ffae69085956e124a1aac018356108a7b9e41d8681507984cce538",
        "extraction_rule": "actionable_paragraph"
      }
    },
    {
      "requirement_id": "req_3a7135ee77ff07a00268",
      "requirement_type": "DOMAIN_ACTION",
      "criticality": "CORE",
      "provenance": {
        "source_file": "tasks/powerlifting-coef-calc/instruction.md",
        "source_type": "instruction",
        "line_start": 20,
        "line_end": 22,
        "exact_text": "Step 3: With the data you have and added in \"Dots\",\nappend a new column \"Dots\" after \"TotalKg\",\nusing Excel formula to compute each lifter's Dots coefficients.\n",
        "source_sha256": "30b6b162c2ffae69085956e124a1aac018356108a7b9e41d8681507984cce538",
        "extraction_rule": "actionable_paragraph"
      }
    }
  ],
